@host = http://127.0.0.1:5001
@token = paste-token-from-login-value-here

### Health (empty JSON object is still required)
POST {{host}}/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Login — replace with your own account
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"your-username","password":"your-password"}

### Search — all criteria are in the JSON body
POST {{host}}/api/orders/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"keyword":"","page":1,"pageSize":10,"sort":"totalDesc"}

### Detail
POST {{host}}/api/orders/detail
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"id":1}

### Permission groups and accounts
POST {{host}}/api/permissions/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}
